The building, tile and prop models in this folder (*.glb) are from the KayKit Medieval Hexagon Pack by
Kay Lousberg (https://kaylousberg.com, https://kaylousberg.itch.io/kaykit-medieval-hexagon), released under
Creative Commons Zero v1.0 Universal (CC0 1.0): https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

They came through pi-lab (compose/www/models), where they were repainted onto one shared clay atlas
(clay.png, 8×4 cells, a derivative of the pack's own texture, also CC0). No attribution is required;
it is given anyway (page panel: "3D models: KayKit (CC0), repainted").

R8 added eleven more straight from the pack (KayKit-Game-Assets/KayKit-Medieval-Hexagon-Pack-1.0, same licence):
building_tower_B_blue, building_tower_catapult_blue, building_mine_blue, building_blacksmith_blue,
building_lumbermill_blue, building_windmill_blue, building_watermill_blue, building_grain, crate_long_A,
fence_stone_straight, tent. www/dev/tools/import-kaykit.mjs converts them the same way (textures stripped, UVs
kept, quantized); they use the same atlas, so they paint with clay.png unchanged.
